"Ploomp is Esh-erdi's female terackerin, a bus-sized river animal bred to enjoy company."
"She has a smooth dark blue back, a catfish-like head, paddle fins and long sharp whiskers."
"On the command Bloat she puffs up a translucent blue riding layer on her back."
"Esh-erdi got her for his nieces; in January 2041 Alden rode her down Wathe's Ribbon."
